WEBVTT

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.761
What you withhold.

00:06:31.846 --> 00:06:33.097
And for whom.

00:06:35.099 --> 00:06:38.727
The world is now one big small town.

00:06:40.062 --> 00:06:43.899
But within that virtual town square,
there are tiers of relationships,

00:06:43.899 --> 00:06:46.318
degrees of intimacy,

00:06:46.318 --> 00:06:49.989
and everyone deserves
a different amount of you,

00:06:49.989 --> 00:06:51.240
a different side.

00:06:52.533 --> 00:06:55.161
Now, where those boundaries lie

00:06:55.202 --> 00:06:56.912
is up to you.

00:06:56.954 --> 00:06:59.290
But in order to make those decisions,

00:06:59.331 --> 00:07:03.043
we must all be our own Cheryl,